{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The night has fallen. The city is gone. Only the undead remain.<br><strong>ZomboCity</strong> is a <strong>score-based FPS</strong> that tests your reflexes, aim, and survival instincts.<br>Fight through endless waves of zombies, rack up points, manage your ammo, and see how long you can last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced <strong>arcade-style gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro </strong>visuals with a low-poly look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless mode</strong> focused on high scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty and <strong>unique enemy types</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive?<br>It\u2019s not easy \u2014 but it\u2019s fun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4122770?t=1761677411","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4122770?t=1761677411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122770/aa3a1ff598fe53755d0ac394e3090b69d8b465a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761677411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122770/aa3a1ff598fe53755d0ac394e3090b69d8b465a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761677411","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The night has fallen. The city is gone. Only the undead remain.<br><strong>ZomboCity</strong> i